item.signalindustries.reinforced.powerSuit.helmet.name=Signalum Power Suit Helmet
item.signalindustries.reinforced.powerSuit.helmet.desc=Upgraded and armored version of the <Prototype Goggles>. Equipped with an AR HUD capable of overlaying information about the world and the suits state onto your vision. Functionality can be extended with <Attachments>.
item.signalindustries.reinforced.powerSuit.chestplate.name=Signalum Power Suit Chestplate
item.signalindustries.reinforced.powerSuit.chestplate.desc=Core of the power suit. Contains the necessary technology for executing <Abilities>. Functionality can be extended with <Attachments>.
