item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.extendedEnergyPack.desc=Provides an extra container for <Signaling Energy>.
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.pulsar.name=The Pulsar (Attachment)
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.pulsar.desc=A modified version of <The Pulsar> that can be connected to a <Signalum Power Suit> allowing it to utilize its energy network.
item.signalindustries.basic.attachment.backpack.name=Basic Backpack
item.signalindustries.basic.attachment.backpack.desc=Portable item & fluid storage. Capable of storing the same amount of items as a chest and 2 fluids (that aren't Signaling Energy).
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.backpack.name=Reinforced Backpack
