item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.wings.name=Crystal Wings
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.wings.desc=Rise above. These wings allow you to fly freely and also act as a heat sink.
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.crown.name=Laser Crown
