item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.breathingApparatus.desc=Allows breathing in otherwise hostile environments. Can extract the oxygen out of water allowing for endless breathing underwater.
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.portableExtractor.name=Portable Extractor
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.portableExtractor.desc=Can extract the energy out of <Signalite Crystals> on the go.
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.energyMaterializer.name=Energy Materializer
item.signalindustries.reinforced.attachment.energyMaterializer.desc=By altering the temperature of released <Signalite Energy> this gadget can place temporary blocks.
